  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project 251GLO2000 includes funds received from various donors in the framework of UN Water to support the implement of the following activities: 
1) UN WWAP production of the UN WWDR2017
2) PCCP activity on trans boundary water resources
3) UNESCO and WWAP activities to be implemented in the framework of the Integrated Monitoring Initiative (GEMI)</narrative>
